AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:178566") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0015821> "Mycosis fungoides (MF) and its variants represent the most common forms of cutaneous T-cell lymphomas. The term MF is restricted to the classical form characterized by the slow progression of patches, plaques and tumors, and to variants with a similar indolent course.")
